OL,4,CUK coldest night forecast            W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GThe UK will experience the coldest   W5
OL,7,Gnight of autumn so far overnight on  W5
OL,8,GFriday, with a widespread frost      W5
OL,9,Gdeveloping as temperatures plummet   W5
OL,10,Gbelow zero.                          W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,GIt will be particularly cold in      W5
OL,13,Gnorthern areas, where temperatures   W5
OL,14,Gof minus 1 (30F) to minus 5C (23F)   W5
OL,15,Gare widely expected from the         W5
OL,16,GMidlands northward.                  W5
OL,17,                                      W5
OL,18,GHowever, in rural areas of Scotland  W5
OL,19,Gwhere there is some lying snow, it   W5
OL,20,Gcould get as low as minus 10C (14F). W5
OL,21,                                      W5
OL,22,                                      W5
